<title>USA: ALPINE SKIING-PROFILE OF TOM STIANSEN.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-PROFILE OF TOM STIANSEN.</headline>
<dateline>BRECKENRIDGE, Colorado 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a brief profile of Tom Stiansen, who won the men's World Cup slalom Sunday in Breckenridge, Colorado:</p>
<p>Age: 26</p>
<p>Nationality: Norway</p>
<p>Previous World Cup victories: none</p>
<p>Other: A former downhiller, Stiansen will race only slalom and giant slalom until after the February world championships.</p>
